{
  "id": "a1.15-simple-continuous",
  "district": "A1",
  "order": 15,
  "title": "Simple или Continuous",
  "theory": [
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "md": "**Present Simple** — обычно, всегда, по расписанию: I **work** at the bank. **Present Continuous** — сейчас или временно: I**’m working** at home today."
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "md": "Глаголы состояния (know, want, like, need, believe) в Continuous почти не бывают: I **know**, а не I am knowing."
    },
    {
      "kind": "table",
      "head": [
        "Simple",
        "Continuous"
      ],
      "rows": [
        {
          "cells": [
            "He usually walks to work.",
            "He's taking the bus today."
          ]
        },
        {
          "cells": [
            "It rains a lot here.",
            "It's raining now."
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "examples": [
    {
      "es": "I usually drink tea, but today I’m drinking coffee.",
      "ru": "Обычно я пью чай, а сегодня пью кофе."
    },
    {
      "es": "She works in Bristol.",
      "ru": "Она работает в Бристоле."
    },
    {
      "es": "I'm staying with friends this week.",
      "ru": "На этой неделе я живу у друзей."
    },
    {
      "es": "I need help.",
      "ru": "Мне нужна помощь."
    }
  ],
